{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17833","headline":"元日呈李逢吉舍人 · 杨巨源","name":"元日呈李逢吉舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华夷文物贺新年，霜仗遥排凤阙前。\n一片彩霞迎曙日，万条红烛动春天。\n称觞山色和元气，端冕炉香叠瑞烟。\n共说正初当圣泽，试过西掖问羣贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}